Running the bathos v0.6.1 sprint. S0, S1, and S3 are done; S2 (sprint-audit fix) is blocked because background session writes require worktree isolation but the WorktreeCreate hook is broken. Run `! python3 -c "import json,pathlib; p=pathlib.Path('.claude/settings.local.json'); d=json.loads(p.read_text()); d['worktree']={'bgIsolation':'none'}; p.write_text(json.dumps(d,indent=2)+'\n')"` in the bathos project directory to unblock.
